- [ ] Confirm the DMI and torque forms from geometry and symmetry.
- [ ] Confirm ansatz and boundary-condition applicability.
- [ ] Inspect all unresolved Wolfram expressions and regression outcomes.
- [ ] Confirm dimensions, signs, limits, and topology conventions.
- [ ] Preserve this report's support level, independent evidence badges, and derived compatibility status when communicating the result.

## Artifact contract

This report is the single layered human-facing rendering. The JSON record is
the authoritative machine-readable source; the `.wl` script and execution logs
are independent derivation evidence. Accessible and formal sections share the
same record ID and may not carry different formulas, assumptions, warnings, or
certainty labels.
